"┌ help ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│ Ctrl-] then a key:                                           │"
"│     n  summon          c  cast                               │"
"│     b  banish          r  recall                             │"
"│     t  timetable       x  close                              │"
"│     j  next            k  previous                           │"
"│     a  needs you       [  scroll                             │"
"│     /  search        1-9  slot                               │"
"│     m  mouse           d  detach                             │"
"│     q  quit            ?  help                               │"
"│    ^]  send ^]                                               │"
"│ Nobody on screen, or a departed one: the keys alone.         │"
"│ Scrolled back: j k a row, b f a screen, g the top, q home.   │"
"│ Search: / back, ? on, then n more the same way, N the other. │"
"│ ● busy  ✦ needs you  ✧ asked you  ○ resting  · departed      │"
"│ [close esc]                                                  │"
"└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
